<title>UK: Conrad says has 96.08 pct of Sheffield Utd. [CORRECTED 09:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>Conrad says has 96.08 pct of Sheffield Utd. [CORRECTED 09:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects figure in headline from 96.8 percent)</p>
<p>British diversified leisurewear company Conrad Plc said on Tuesday it had received valid acceptances for 96.08 percent of issued ordinary and original share capital of Sheffield United Football Club Ltd.</p>
<p>Conrad said it had acceptances for 2,770 ordinary shares and 98 original shares.</p>
<p>In December, Conrad said the offer was worth around 14.9 million pounds, based on the 60p price at which new Conrad shares are being offered.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
